No law text is published. This repository holds metadata only.

Catalogue entries (bill number, title, Royal Assent date, chapter, coming-into-force line) are facts
recorded by the Legislative Assembly of Alberta (https://www.assembly.ab.ca). Source: Legislative Assembly
of Alberta. No text of its documents is reproduced; nothing here is an official version, or made in
affiliation with or endorsed by the Legislative Assembly of Alberta.

The "legal-system" facts come from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org), released under CC0 1.0.

The statutes of Alberta are published by the Alberta King's Printer (https://kings-printer.alberta.ca).
They are not copied here.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
